# Egress FQDN allowlist for the Vaultwarden -> Entra OIDC path (default-deny).
# POSIX extended regex, matched against the request/CONNECT host (case-insensitive).
# Keep this list as tight as possible — every entry is a permitted egress target.

# Entra OIDC: discovery, JWKS, authorize, and token endpoints all live here.
^login\.microsoftonline\.com$

# Entra OIDC userinfo endpoint (used on some validation/session paths).
^graph\.microsoft\.com$
